WEBVTT

00:04:58.280 --> 00:05:00.656
This heat is hard to bear

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:02.216
Get a pumper

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:04.336
Drop the water from above

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:06.856
Send it here and there

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:08.720
This heat is hard to bear

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:10.640
(Synth music)

00:05:17.840 --> 00:05:19.976
I'm so dizzy, the air is so hot

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:22.096
Beads of sweat runnin' down my back

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:24.256
All my friends are made of wax

00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:26.376
moving slowly, they gonna melt

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:28.536
Knees are bending, the heat so high

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:30.656
Wind's so heavy, the bees can't fly